        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UnBound is a relaxing first-person adventure game where players collect orbs scattered throughout an island environment. Collect agility orbs to level-up your speed and jump abilities to reach the hidden secret orbs. Explore the tranquil environment while listening to chill, atmospheric music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play three different game modes including Adventure mode (find all secret orbs hidden on the island), Survival mode (see how many days you can last on the island while your health drains over time), and Challenge mode featuring five levels with unique objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in 2011 as an Xbox Live Indie Game, this version of UnBound has been re-released in the spirit of the original game for preservation and for future players to experience.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UnBound is a relaxing first-person adventure game where players collect orbs scattered throughout an island environment. Collect agility orbs to level-up your speed and jump abilities to reach the hidden secret orbs. Explore the tranquil environment while listening to chill, atmospheric music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play three different game modes including Adventure mode (find all secret orbs hidden on the island), Survival mode (see how many days you can last on the island while your health drains over time), and Challenge mode featuring five levels with unique objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in 2011 as an Xbox Live Indie Game, this version of UnBound has been re-released in the spirit of the original game for preservation and for future players to experience.</p>",
